          <change when="2023-06-19T13:37:27-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/gclaytor">Submit - Probably more to be done if and when an image is made available, but for now I rejected the restoration [καὶ τὰ ἄλλα] in l. 8, as the phrase τὰ ἄλλα ἀκολούθως is associated with abstracts and copies (e.g. https://papyri.info/ddbdp/basp;50;89 and https://papyri.info/ddbdp/p.fam.tebt;;3), marking the omission of clauses, whereas P.Kron. 23 is an original contract, as the subscriptions and registration show. https://papyri.info/ddbdp/c.pap.gr;1;34 shows ἀκολούθως in a different context at the end of an original contract. Also removed the erroneously-inserted hypen in Τ̣α[ορσενοῦ]φις in l. 13</change>
